====== ZyXEL NR7101 ======

/* This template is intended to be used via https://openwrt.org/meta/create_new_device_page . */

The ZyXEL NR7101 is an 802.3at PoE powered 5G/NR, IP68 certified, outdoor ethernet router/bridge with integrated directional 5G/NR MIMO antennas. It has a WiFi radio, and a GPS in the modem, but these should be considered secondary functions.  The WiFi antennas are integrated in the main PCB.

