===== Disable SIM based automatic APN configuration =====

The modem comes with Quectel's automatic APN configuration enabled.  This is known to interfere with manual configuration, causing hard to debug issues. Disabling the feaure is highly recommended.  Take it from someone who spend days debugging all sorts of weird connection issues before taking this advice....

   AT+QMBNCFG="AutoSel",0
   AT+QMBNCFG="Deactivate"

Check if VoLTE is enabled:
    AT+QCFG="volte_disable"
and disable it if necessary:
    AT+QCFG="volte_disable",1


===== Modem firmware upgrade =====

<WRAP center round important 60%>
WARNING: Never reboot the NR7101 or remove power while the modem is being upgraded.  If the process appears to fail then wait patiently. The modem will retry several times before giving up.  Any attempt to forcefully cancel the process might brick the modem. 
</WRAP>

